       EVP_KDF-X942-CONCAT - The X942 Concat EVP_KDF implementation

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       The EVP_KDF-X942-CONCAT algorithm is identical to EVP_KDF-X963. It is
       used for key agreement to derive a key using input such as a shared
       secret key and shared info.

   IIddeennttiittyy
       "X942KDF_CONCAT" is the name for this implementation; it can be used
       with the EEVVPP__KKDDFF__ffeettcchh(()) function.

       This is an alias for "X963KDF".

       See EEVVPP__KKDDFF--XX996633(7) for a list of supported parameters and examples.

